From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: FormalSnake <kyaniserni@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 17:03:50 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] gpui: mix a share of a backdrop's unblurred region into its
 blur

macOS's Liquid Glass keeps what lies behind it sharp under a wide blur:
over 30 pt colour bands its small glass reads about a third of the
unblurred bands plus a 15 pt blur. BackdropFilter::sharp sets that
share. The composite binds the region as copied out of the frame next
to the blurred one and mixes the two before the tone or saturation.
---
